  {
    "RowId": 40099,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40100,
    "Text": "Defeat Virazahn!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40101,
    "Text": "Quell the Perch of the Apex!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40102,
    "Text": "Today we learn who the true hero is."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40103,
    "Text": "I've had enough of his dribble! It's time to knock that smirk off his face!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40104,
    "Text": "Hehe... The Perch of the Apex awakens!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40105,
    "Text": "Run! Run or be crushed under a hail of stones!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40106,
    "Text": "Hah hah hah! Not even you are nimble enough to escape this! Give up, for I am invincible!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40107,
    "Text": "Impressive footwork...but all legs must tire in time!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40108,
    "Text": "Heh, you are as fierce as they say. Yet I wield potions concocted by Thavnair's finest alchemists!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40109,
    "Text": "You have done well, but your fight ends here. My alchemical minions shall be your downfall!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40110,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40111,
    "Text": "Even I was hard-pressed to defeat them... And today they show that no hero is immortal!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40112,
    "Text": "Flee now and you may live to fight again!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40113,
    "Text": "You...you defeated them already!? Uh... But of course, who would wish this duel to end so quickly!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40114,
    "Text": "What!? My armor! MY ARMOR!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40115,
    "Text": "The artifact... I've never seen it shine so..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40116,
    "Text": "Hahaha! Such power as I've never witnessed before! The apex roars with fury untold!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40117,
    "Text": "Its...power yet grows!? In the face of greater danger, I become ever more unassailable!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40118,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40119,
    "Text": "Why won't you fall!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40120,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40121,
    "Text": "This...this cannot be! I am meant to be king...I will not fall ere I ascend the throne!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40122,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40123,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40124,
    "Text": "Get out here, you bloody things! Just...just stop them, now!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40125,
    "Text": "We...we both suffer grievous wounds. Perhaps we should...consider this a draw..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40126,
    "Text": "I'm utterly defenseless... This rotten piece of wood was supposed to make me invincible!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40127,
    "Text": "It's...it's out of control!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40128,
    "Text": "What's...what's happening!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40129,
    "Text": "I can't...I can't move... The artifact, it's..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40130,
    "Text": "M-Money, you like money, yes? I'll give you as much as you want, just don't let me die!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40131,
    "Text": "Ungh... It can't...it can't end like this. I won't let it... I won't let it!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40132,
    "Text": "Virazahn can't suppress the fear in his heart, and the apex has responded in kind. We have to stop it!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40133,
    "Text": "But I am...a hero... Someone...someone save me..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40134,
    "Text": "Ungh... I cannot lose..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40135,
    "Text": "It'll swallow us if we don't stop it soon!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40136,
    "Text": "Don't you ever shut up!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40137,
    "Text": "You've lost, Virazahn. Lay down your weapon!"
  },
