  },
  {
    "RowId": 40300,
    "Text": "This is nothing personal, but I must have your soul!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40301,
    "Text": "Electrope has many uses. Watch and learn!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40302,
    "Text": "If one needs wings, one need simply make them!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40303,
    "Text": "I'll erase you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40304,
    "Text": "Begone."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40305,
    "Text": "There is no limit to electrope's potential."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40306,
    "Text": "You cannot outrun lightning!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40307,
    "Text": "Take this!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40308,
    "Text": "How's this!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40309,
    "Text": "Wicked Thunder has returned to the ring!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40310,
    "Text": "Oooh, look at that massive cannon! Her skills are as sharp as ever!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40311,
    "Text": "She's grown wings! How wickedly divine!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40312,
    "Text": "I cannot...I must not lose!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40313,
    "Text": "Just die already!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40314,
    "Text": "I need your soul!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40315,
    "Text": "No... I cannot die here..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40316,
    "Text": "I have no choice but to surrender to electrope... "
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40317,
    "Text": "Aaarrrgh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40318,
    "Text": "I will not fail..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40319,
    "Text": "My body will hold... It must!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40320,
    "Text": "Aaarrrgh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40321,
    "Text": "Now our battle truly begins!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40322,
    "Text": "Wicked Thunder is discharging vast amounts of aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40323,
    "Text": "Egads! Something is growing from her body!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40324,
    "Text": "She's taken electrope into her body and unleashed a new feral soul!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40325,
    "Text": "Dance, my blade, and carve my enemy's flesh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40326,
    "Text": "My flames return all to ash!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40327,
    "Text": "Electrope converts even the aether of my flesh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40328,
    "Text": "Rain, my blade, and drown my foes in cuts!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40329,
    "Text": "It's over! I will have your soul!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40330,
    "Text": "Hyaaah!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40331,
    "Text": "How do you like this!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40332,
    "Text": "No quarter!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40333,
    "Text": "How are you still standing?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40334,
    "Text": "She's gathering aether...but to what end!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40335,
    "Text": "She's using electrope to convert her body's aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40336,
    "Text": "A battle so electrifying I dare not blink!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40337,
    "Text": "Defeat Wicked Thunder"
  },
  {
